=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ ZSTD @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt Zstandard (zstd) @VERSION@ for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt Zstandard is free software, dual-licensed under BSD and GPLv2; see LICENSE and COPYING.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [ZSTD.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for Zstandard (zstd)
    At system startup: to define ZSTD$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:ZSTD$STARTUP.COM
    For each user: to define the commands, add this line to LOGIN.COM:
    $ @ZSTD$ROOT:[000000]ZSTD$SETUP.COM

PRODUCT REMOVE ZSTD removes the product and deassigns ZSTD$ROOT.
